            <span id="alg1.l7.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">end</span> <span id="alg1.l7.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">if</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l8" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l8.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">8:</span></span>
            
            
            <span id="alg1.l8.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Reward update:</span> Update each <math id="alg1.l8.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="r_{k}(x,y)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r_{k}(x,y)</annotation></semantics></math> using Eq. (<a href="#S2.E10" title="In 2 Multi-Expert Preference Alignment ‣ Mix- and MoE-DPO: A Variational Inference Approach to Direct Preference Optimization" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">10</span></a>).

</div>
